grounding_1- "qps checklist shows qps/bin tasks complete and qps/qps/checklist.qps cipher.foreign_and_structured_semantics separately ready";
grounding_2- "qps/bin/_index.qps defines qps/bin as small operator-facing terminal tools with Python as the preferred orchestration language";
grounding_3- "qps/bin/cv is a Python command that validates candidate QPS before publication and reports PASS/FAIL evidence";
grounding_4- "qps/cpp/src/main.cpp owns qps subcommands while qps/bin/cv remains a standalone terminal command";
